---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="AI Tools | ClearTechExplained" 
    description="Explore practical AI tools for writing, productivity, research, automation, and content creation." />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main>
      <h1>AI Tools</h1>

      <p>
        Explore practical AI tools that can help you work smarter, create content,
        improve productivity, and learn new skills.
      </p>

      <h2>Featured AI Tools</h2>

      <div>
        <h3>ChatGPT</h3>
        <p>
          An AI assistant that helps with writing, coding, research, learning,
          brainstorming, and problem-solving.
        </p>

        <h3>Google Gemini</h3>
        <p>
          Google's AI assistant for answering questions, generating content,
          and assisting with productivity tasks.
        </p>

        <h3>Claude</h3>
        <p>
          A conversational AI designed for writing, analysis, coding,
          and document processing.
        </p>

        <h3>Perplexity AI</h3>
        <p>
          An AI-powered search engine that provides answers with cited sources.
        </p>

        <h3>Canva AI</h3>
        <p>
          Create graphics, social media posts, presentations,
          and marketing materials with AI assistance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2>What You'll Learn</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>How to use AI tools effectively</li>
        <li>AI tools for content creation</li>
        <li>AI tools for students and researchers</li>
        <li>AI productivity workflows</li>
        <li>Free and affordable AI resources</li>
      </ul>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>